# Frontend UI

- Reuse system primitives. Do not create a second UI system: spacing, fonts, radius, buttons, inputs, list shells, or semantic colors. Standard: `docs/specs/architecture/ADR-011-hostflow-ui-platform-standard.md`.
- Functional components. PascalCase components. camelCase hooks and helpers.
- Keep Tailwind utilities in the `tsx` file that uses them.
- Do not add a local task, note, document, status, dictionary, form-control, or styling system. Compose existing primitives.
- A new route gets a test. Do not restyle unrelated screens.
- The layout check is `node scripts/check-adr011-ui-patterns.mjs --fail` from `hostflow-frontend`. There is no `ui:adr011:check` script in `package.json`.
